opjson records facts about One Piece Card Game cards and products: card numbers, names, costs, power, colours,
types, rarities, block icons, which set each printing comes from, and which TCGplayer product is which printing.
No effect text, rules text, description or card art is copied into the data.

The facts come from the official English card list (https://en.onepiece-cardgame.com/cardlist/), the official
Japanese card list and product pages (https://www.onepiece-cardgame.com/cardlist/), and from TCGplayer's catalogue as mirrored by TCGCSV (https://tcgcsv.com). Card images in the data are links to those
sites, not copies. The images, card names and the ONE PIECE marks belong to Eiichiro Oda/Shueisha, Toei
Animation and Bandai. Anyone who displays them is responsible for having the right to.

The import tools compare the two sites' card images by perceptual hash to tell which TCGplayer product is which
printing. The images are downloaded to a local cache for that comparison and are never committed.
